cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "GRAIN: Group-Referenced Analysis of Individual Natural-Language Expression"
message: "If you use this method or code, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "HUO"
    given-names: "Kean"
version: 1.1.1
date-released: 2026-09-03
abstract: >
  A group-referenced analysis method for constructing multiscale individual
  language-texture objects from natural-language behavior. GRAIN integrates
  condition selection, conditional expression, temporal paths, interaction,
  reference-relative geometry, uncertainty, and inference-level safeguards
  without claiming a finished scale, diagnosis, or validated personality
  taxonomy.
